1
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,000
Mutual Invitation.

2
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,860
(Recap)

3
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,140
(Invitation. Yu Yang & Liang Renfang)
Where do you want to go?

4
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,680
I want to go...

5
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,060
(Into your heart)

6
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,560
I wrote to you

7
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,400
and Liang Xiaoyu

8
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,480
I don't even want to write
your name now.

9
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,160
Being around you has given me

10
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,200
so much energy and vitality.

11
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,880
I hope you don't feel pressured.

12
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,200
I'm taking back my feelings.

13
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,440
Oh, Meng...

14
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,400
You have to watch me.

15
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,720
Watch you.

16
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:09,240
Okay.

17
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,520
I'll say it again.

18
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,520
You have to watch me.

19
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,440
She's killing me with that.

20
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,520
♪Don't stay trapped inside your room♪

21
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,920
♪Outside the window,
the rain has cleared♪

22
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,200
♪Set reality aside♪

23
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,520
♪Follow your heart♪

24
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,880
♪What you've been longing
for is right ahead♪

25
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:24,360
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

26
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:27,240
♪Just be a little braver♪

27
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:30,000
♪Come closer, come closer♪

28
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,080
♪There's a little spark
shining in your eyes♪

29
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:35,200
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

30
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,920
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

31
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:43,060
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=

32
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,080
Who is this?

33
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,720
Who?

34
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,160
Who is she?

35
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:52,920
Is that Si or Xing?

36
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,640
It's Si. Look at her eyes.

37
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:57,040
If you want to know if it's Si or Xing,

38
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,400
just see who she's on a date with.

39
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:03,420
(Glances)

40
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,940
(Hello)

41
00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:08,060
(Smiles)
Cui Yihang.

42
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:14,840
Hi.

43
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,240
Hello.

44
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,660
(Imitating)

45
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,480
This is for you.

46
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,560
Thanks.

47
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,680
There were a lot of balloons at first,
but...

48
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:28,300
(Looks up)

49
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,860
(One of a kind)

50
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,600
When I opened the door,

51
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,600
they all...

52
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:32,680
Flew away?

53
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,080
Yeah.

54
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,800
He has this goofy, adorable vibe.

55
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,520
So cute.

56
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,200
It's a shame.

57
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,280
Here, you can hold this for now.

58
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,000
Thanks.

59
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,680
Careful.

60
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,320
Are your shoes okay?
Are you comfortable?

61
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,200
Yeah, I'm fine.

62
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,680
Thanks for the flowers.

63
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,160
I'm surprised.

64
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:04,680
Look.

65
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,440
Everyone uses cute doubled-up words

66
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,080
when they're with Si and Xing.

67
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:07,800
Flowers.

68
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:08,860
A doubled-up word.

69
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:09,480
(Looks at the flowers)

70
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,200
Take a look.

71
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,040
Is this a kite?

72
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,600
A kite.

73
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,520
You can draw something on it.

74
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,880
We can draw on it?

75
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:18,680
Yeah.

76
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,360
This is...

77
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:26,620
(Helping)

78
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:28,520
I don't think this can hang here.

79
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,800
It'll fly this way.

80
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,880
It keeps going this way, right?

81
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:31,320
Yeah.

82
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,400
Hit it. This balloon is so "bad".

83
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:36,540
(Looks down)

84
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,560
Give it to me.

85
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,960
They both wore white.

86
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,840
Even the gifts they brought are blue.

87
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,560
They're so in sync.

88
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,440
Let me think.

89
00:03:57,060 --> 00:03:58,260
(Glances)

90
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,560
Did you guess it?

91
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,200
When you

92
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,080
came out today.

93
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,600
Guess what?

94
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,560
What we'd be doing
and who you'd be with.

95
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,760
I didn't.

96
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,880
(Teasing)

97
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,920
I didn't.

98
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,720
You.

99
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,620
(Laughs at the teasing)

100
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,120
Si is so cute.

101
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,040
So cute.

102
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,500
(Covers mouth and laughs)

103
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,920
Did anything fun happen to you today?

104
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:27,860
(Asking)

105
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,560
Going on a date with you.

106
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,360
(Corrects)
Just being with you makes me happy.

107
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:34,620
(Say more if you can)

108
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,960
Just being with you makes me happy.

109
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,500
(Just being with you makes me happy)
Seeing you made my day.

110
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,440
(Seeing you made my day)

111
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,360
So happy.

112
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,400
I was really looking forward

113
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,280
to being alone with you.

114
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:55,220
(Glances)

115
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:04,120
I know what I want to draw now.

116
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:08,180
(Glances)

117
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,040
My heart is already leaning toward you.

118
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:13,100
(Glances)

119
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,440
What is he drawing?

120
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,120
He couldn't hide his smile.

121
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,400
Do you feel like anything's different?

122
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,560
Who do you mean?

123
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,520
Me.

124
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:30,080
You?

125
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:34,820
(Sits up straight)

126
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,080
What's different from usual?

127
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,560
Where's your mole?

128
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,960
He started looking for the mole.

129
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,800
Do you want to take a look
and see who I am?

130
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,520
You scared me.

131
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:47,860
(Hahaha)

132
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,720
Could you be...

133
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,280
be...

134
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:51,680
Xing.

135
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,880
You're Xing.

136
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,200
That scared him.

137
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,760
(Better take a close look)
He quickly takes a look.

138
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:57,980
You scared me.

139
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:59,020
(Joking)

140
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,320
What's hitting me?

141
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,120
The balloon.

142
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,360
That's hilarious.

143
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,040
Seriously, Cui Yihang gets

144
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,400
so much cuter around Si.

145
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,760
They're drawing each other.

146
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,120
I'm done.

147
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:16,920
But it's kind of...

148
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,040
Let me see.

149
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:20,540
(Double portrait)

150
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,760
I think yours turned out pretty well.

151
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,960
You even have some facial hair
on the side.

152
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,400
No, this part here is...

153
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,640
Contour?

154
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,520
How should I put it?

155
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,200
Blush.

156
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:33,320
Isn't blush supposed to go here?

157
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:33,960
Where?

158
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:34,960
Here.

159
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:36,160
Why don't you use a different color?

160
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,480
Here?

161
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,640
This one is much better.

162
00:06:44,340 --> 00:06:45,300
(Better)

163
00:06:45,380 --> 00:06:46,540
(Can't hold it in)

164
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:48,200
(This one's hard to judge)

165
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:48,880
What does that mean?

166
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,560
I'm dying laughing.

167
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,640
(Better)
Maybe it doesn't look that good to you.

168
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,280
It's pretty good.

169
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:59,060
(Looks away)

170
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,040
Anything else?

171
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:02,680
Write something.

172
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,520
(Avoiding eye contact)
Sure.

173
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,360
We can

174
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,520
describe each other.

175
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,560
Okay.

176
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:07,740
Just write down a feeling.

177
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,740
(Looks down)

178
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,960
The way they look at each other
is so funny.

179
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,700
Like, when I look at you,

180
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:18,120
and you look at me,

181
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,520
I won't look at you.

182
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,520
Then as soon as you look away,

183
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:19,960
I look at you.

184
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,480
Shyly looking away.

185
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,800
The way they act around each other.

186
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,920
That's so cute.

187
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,840
Yeah.

188
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:34,720
You're thinking.

189
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,080
Yeah.

190
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,760
Of course I have to think about it.

191
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,680
If you get that on your pants,

192
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,680
it won't be easy to wipe off.

193
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:45,760
It scared me.

194
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,880
This is a single strand.

195
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,440
It's you.

196
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,100
(A "Si")
[*A single strand]

197
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,330
Oh my gosh.

198
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:52,800
A strand (Si).

199
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,640
There's a single strand (Si) here.

200
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,400
It's you.

201
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,280
He thought about it forever,

202
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,640
and that's all he came up with.

203
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,520
His dry humor.

204
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,410
Oh my gosh.

205
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,920
He's so funny.

206
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,040
This is a single strand.

207
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,840
It's you.

208
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,460
(A single strand (Si))
There are two strands (Si).

209
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,440
He even glanced to the side,

210
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,120
probably thinking

211
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,200
it was a pretty good idea.

212
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:19,920
You done?

213
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:20,640
I'm done.

214
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:24,120
(At the same time)
One, two, three.

215
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:28,020
(Cui Yihang.
To ss: Safety, health, surprises)

216
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:28,960
Safety.

217
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,040
Health.

218
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:30,600
Surprises.

219
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,360
The more I get to know you,

220
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,120
the more surprises I discover about you.

221
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,440
And even a little shocked,

222
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,640
to be honest.

223
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,840
There are just so many things

224
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,840
I'd never expect.

225
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,280
You're pretty special.

226
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,280
And that makes me feel
a little surprised.

227
00:08:42,420 --> 00:08:44,380
(Feeling surprised)

228
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:44,880
Okay.

229
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,000
I like it.

230
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,420
(I like it)

231
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,600
So happy.

232
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,280
What's this?

233
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,960
(Wu Siying. Sense of security)
Sense of security.

234
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,360
I guess I feel that way

235
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,640
when we're

236
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,280
cooking together,

237
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,720
or when you're driving,

238
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,040
or when it's just the two of us.

239
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:08,840
I feel

240
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,800
really safe with you.

241
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,560
Have you ever had donkey meat pastries?

242
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,540
(Cui Yihang
bought the donkey meat pastries)

243
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,320
No.

244
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,200
You've never had it?

245
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,000
Never.

246
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,280
I'll let you try something different.

247
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:19,340
(I'll let you try something different)

248
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,320
Is there anything you can't reach?

249
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:20,820
(Asking)

250
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,680
I want to try those fries.

251
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,160
Take two.

252
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,620
(Hands over)
One is enough.

253
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,880
Okay, thanks.

254
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:28,360
Here.

255
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:30,460
(Hands over)

256
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,680
Is this about done?

257
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,240
It's okay.

258
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:40,640
Give it to me.

259
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,760
It's fine.

260
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,080
It's okay.

261
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,320
See? You weren't listening.

262
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,040
Don't get your hands dirty.

263
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,000
He's a little bossy.

264
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,560
Give it to me.

265
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,720
Go sit down for a bit.

266
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,880
Cui Yihang usually seems pretty quiet.

267
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:50,840
But when he talks...

268
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:52,740
Let's dig in.

269
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:54,460
(Serves food)
Come on.

270
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,040
This is the second dish you mentioned.

271
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:56,960
Yeah.

272
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,720
It's okay. I'll bring you

273
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,160
the third and fourth dishes.

274
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:01,380
(I'll bring you the third
and fourth dishes)

275
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:02,760
Do you want to go grocery shopping?

276
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,200
I mean, do you want
to go grocery shopping?

277
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,020
(Asking softly)

278
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,720
Flirting with Si

279
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,960
and getting himself all shy.

280
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,800
Look at that.

281
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:20,740
(Can't help it)

282
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,120
Look at his legs.

283
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,760
Look at those legs.

284
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,240
The wind's picking up.

285
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,640
Do you want to give it a try?

286
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,480
Sure.

287
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,400
Let's go try it.

288
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,320
It's raining.

289
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,000
Oh, it's raining.

290
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:42,720
It's raining.

