606
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,190
It really caught you off guard.

607
00:22:16,190 --> 00:22:18,400
Yeah, I was totally stunned.

608
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,520
Then I thought,

609
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:21,840
