694
00:25:35,020 --> 00:25:35,760
There's nothing you can do about it.

695
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:36,440
Nothing you can do.

696
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,120
Yeah.

697
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:38,400
That's just fate.

698
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:39,840
It's just that feeling.

699
00:25:39,840 --> 00:25:41,280
In that moment, I just felt...

700
