00:28:19,600 --> 00:28:20,720
You rest.

751
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:21,240
I'm fine.

752
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,520
I've recovered now.

753
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,000
I'm okay. I'm fine.

