854
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:49,320
He was really worried about Xing.

855
00:31:49,320 --> 00:31:50,280
She's okay. She's doing good.

856
00:31:50,280 --> 00:31:51,280
She's doing okay now.

857
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:52,960
I'm staying here with her today.

858
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:54,120
