(Looking on)

873
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:27,200
Sun Bohan's feeling even worse now.

874
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:28,120
My heart hurts for him.

875
00:32:46,420 --> 00:32:48,140
(Peeking out to look)

876
00:32:53,580 --> 00:32:56,820
(Emergency)

877
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:08,680
She's okay.

878
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,840
She's fine now.

879
00:33:09,840 --> 00:33:10,320
She's fine.

880
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,760
And Xing wanted me

881
00:33:11,760 --> 00:33:13,120
to tell you before her surgery.

882
00:33:13,120 --> 00:33:14,000
The flowers you gave her

883
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,720
are the same color as her outfit today.

884
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:08,920
She's fine after the surgery.

885
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,440
Don't worry.

886
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:28,240
Wait a second.

887
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:37,920
Sometimes,

888
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:39,200
it takes a crisis

889
00:34:39,200 --> 00:34:40,080
to make you realize

890
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:41,320
just how much

891
00:34:41,680 --> 00:34:43,000
someone really

892
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,200
means to you.

893
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,480
I want to see them go on a date.

894
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:49,720
When she said the flowers

895
00:34:49,720 --> 00:34:51,240
were the same color as her outfit,

896
00:34:51,240 --> 00:34:52,440
that line

897
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,600
really got to me.

898
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,560
She's okay.

899
00:34:55,640 --> 00:34:56,680
But I think this whole thing

900
00:34:56,680 --> 00:34:58,640
will bring the four of them

901
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:00,280
even closer together.

902
00:35:00,280 --> 00:35:01,560
(Bringing them even closer)

903
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:02,860
(Bringing closer)
And back in the car,

904
00:35:02,860 --> 00:35:04,720
they were already bonding like family,

905
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:07,000
checking in on each other

906
00:35:07,520 --> 00:35:09,280
and having each other's backs.

907
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:11,160
Because being a couple

908
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:12,660
isn't just about

909
00:35:12,660 --> 00:35:14,000
being romantic, going out for meals,

910
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:15,680
buying flowers, or giving gifts.

911
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:17,240
You have to face things together.

912
00:35:17,590 --> 00:35:18,360
(Agrees)
When something happens...

913
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,320
Emotions can run high.

914
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,840
Right. And when that happens,

915
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:21,880
what matters is

916
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:22,760
whether the two of you

917
00:35:22,760 --> 00:35:24,120
can hold on to each other

918
00:35:24,120 --> 00:35:24,880
and get through it together.

919
00:35:25,600 --> 00:35:26,560
That's incredibly important

920
00:35:26,560 --> 00:35:28,400
in a relationship.

921
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:31,280
I think this experience

922
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,640
might make them realize

923
00:35:32,640 --> 00:35:34,080
that they actually care about

924
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:35,720
and like each other

925
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:36,760
more than they thought.

926
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:37,680
Right.

927
00:35:37,680 --> 00:35:39,280
I'm sure Xing

928
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:40,560
was also worried

929
00:35:40,560 --> 00:35:42,480
that Sun Bohan
might be panicking outside.

930
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:43,520
But she

931
00:35:43,520 --> 00:35:44,200
probably never expected

932
00:35:44,200 --> 00:35:46,280
to see Sun Bohan crying like that.

933
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:47,380
It was such a different side of him.

934
00:35:47,380 --> 00:35:48,400
(Seeing another side of Sun Bohan)
It's okay.

935
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:49,440
Xing is fine now.

936
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:50,320
It's okay.

937
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:53,320
This was just an unexpected setback.

938
00:35:53,680 --> 00:35:55,000
It all happened

939
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,400
so suddenly.

940
00:35:56,400 --> 00:35:57,200
Way too suddenly.

941
00:35:57,200 --> 00:35:57,960
I hope Xing

942
00:35:57,960 --> 00:35:59,480
can return to the house soon

943
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:01,200
and reunite

944
00:36:01,200 --> 00:36:02,760
with everyone

945
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,440
in the Signal House.

946
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,080
I hope everyone

947
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:06,560
remembers

948
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:08,200
to eat on time

949
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:09,160
and take good care

950
00:36:09,160 --> 00:36:10,160
of themselves.

951
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:11,560
That way, the people you love

952
00:36:11,560 --> 00:36:12,480
and those who care about you

953
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:14,480
won't have to worry.

954
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:23,840
Sha Yue'er doesn't have a date.

955
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:25,040
She doesn't have one today.

956
00:36:25,040 --> 00:36:26,000
Look at her.

957
00:36:26,680 --> 00:36:27,840
Because there are two days of dates,

958
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:28,960
she only gets one, right?

959
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:29,760
Right.

960
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:32,000
Everyone else is out on dates today,

961
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,360
so she's home by herself.

962
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:41,240
This is not a freeze frame.

963
00:36:50,240 --> 00:36:51,080
She looks down.

964
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,400
She seems so lonely.

965
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:01,040
These flowers

966
00:37:01,640 --> 00:37:03,300
are for you.

967
00:37:05,210 --> 00:37:06,310
Oh my gosh!

968
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:08,080
Why did you get me flowers?

969
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:10,360
I knew you'd like them.

970
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:11,520
Oh my gosh!

971
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:13,440
You're so sweet.

972
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,400
They're beautiful.

973
00:37:14,680 --> 00:37:15,680
Here's to friendship.

974
00:37:16,240 --> 00:37:17,120
Nice.

975
00:37:17,200 --> 00:37:18,000
That's so sweet.

976
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:18,680
Nice.

977
00:37:18,680 --> 00:37:19,920
I thought if there were
too many people around,

978
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,640
I'd wait until you got back

979
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,320
to your room to give them to you.

980
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:23,280
Love you so much.

981
00:37:24,010 --> 00:37:24,420
Stop.

982
00:37:25,960 --> 00:37:26,800
Nice.

983
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,960
Very nice.

984
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:29,240
Let's put them out first.

985
00:37:29,240 --> 00:37:31,360
Are you taking them back to your room
or putting them somewhere first?

986
00:37:31,360 --> 00:37:32,480
I'll take them back first.

987
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:33,440
Yeah, go ahead.

988
00:37:33,440 --> 00:37:34,920
I'll keep an eye on the kitchen.

989
00:37:36,500 --> 00:37:38,460
(Liang Renfang returns
to the Signal House)

990
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:42,920
Hi,

991
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:44,400
gorgeous.

992
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:45,520
I brought you guys pizza.

993
00:37:46,600 --> 00:37:47,480
And some bread.

994
00:37:48,900 --> 00:37:50,460
(Cao Yiheng and Yu Yang
return to the Signal House)

995
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,240
Who is it?

996
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:54,240
Cao Yiheng?

997
00:37:56,040 --> 00:37:56,760
Hi.

998
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:57,840
What did you buy?

999
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,480
Why do you have so much stuff?

1000
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:00,680
Did you buy groceries again?

1001
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:02,280
This is...

1002
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:03,360
What's this?

1003
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:04,720
This is the menu.

1004
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,280
Tofu soup.

1005
00:38:09,200 --> 00:38:10,480
Let's make it another day.

1006
00:38:10,480 --> 00:38:10,920
Sure.

1007
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:11,880
I'm taking a break today.

1008
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:12,520
Okay.

1009
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:14,420
Are you sure you won't get hungry later?

1010
00:38:14,420 --> 00:38:15,360
(Asks)

1011
00:38:15,360 --> 00:38:16,520
Even if I do, I'm not eating.

1012
00:38:18,120 --> 00:38:20,360
I could barely fit into the dress
I tried on today.

1013
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:21,680
I really can't eat anymore.

1014
00:38:22,600 --> 00:38:23,720
I'm done eating.

1015
00:38:23,720 --> 00:38:24,760
Same here.

1016
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:28,680
Not many dishes today.

1017
00:38:28,680 --> 00:38:29,170
Nice.

1018
00:38:33,680 --> 00:38:35,000
Hello.

1019
00:38:36,080 --> 00:38:36,560
Hello.

1020
00:38:36,560 --> 00:38:38,000
Hi.

1021
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:40,080
Are there only five of us here today?

1022
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:42,080
Looks like everyone else
is out on dates.

1023
00:38:42,080 --> 00:38:42,640
So basically,

1024
00:38:42,640 --> 00:38:44,400
everyone else is on a date.

1025
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:49,520
Eight people went out today.

1026
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:50,120
Really?

1027
00:38:51,120 --> 00:38:51,880
I think so.

1028
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:53,280
There are still eight people
who aren't back yet.

1029
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:54,280
Have you eaten?

1030
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:56,480
Just a little.

1031
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:57,400
Some pizza.

1032
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,440
You've eaten already, right?

1033
00:39:01,520 --> 00:39:02,320
So fair.

1034
00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:03,780
So fair.

1035
00:39:03,780 --> 00:39:04,780
She really knows
how to compliment people.

1036
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,240
Feeling down.

1037
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:09,920
Are you done washing up?

1038
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:10,920
There's still so much left.

1039
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:11,760
Here, I'll do it.

1040
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,480
You go.

1041
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:13,200
What a good bestie.

1042
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:13,640
I'll do it.

1043
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:14,760
Look at you.

1044
00:39:14,760 --> 00:39:15,680
I'm fast at washing dishes.

1045
00:39:16,240 --> 00:39:17,440
No one's eating the eggs.

1046
00:39:17,780 --> 00:39:18,440
I'll have a couple more bites.

1047
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:20,000
Was this supposed
to be thickened with starch?

1048
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:20,480
Yeah.

1049
00:39:29,520 --> 00:39:30,720
All right, I'll do it.

1050
00:39:30,720 --> 00:39:32,360
You can put an apron on me.

1051
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:33,680
Okay.

1052
00:39:37,120 --> 00:39:38,600
I think I'm past the point
of being hungry.

1053
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:39,960
That'll do.

1054
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:40,680
Okay.

1055
00:39:40,680 --> 00:39:41,820
(what a mess)

1056
00:39:43,680 --> 00:39:44,520
Sorry.

1057
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:46,440
What are you doing?

1058
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:47,280
Sorry.

1059
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:50,520
Poor Yiheng didn't eat a single bite,

1060
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:51,640
but still ended up
washing all the dishes.

1061
00:39:51,640 --> 00:39:52,160
It's fine.

1062
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:53,520
Help me push up my sleeve.

1063
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:54,560
Coming.

1064
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:58,640
It's okay. Don't roll it up.

1065
00:39:58,640 --> 00:39:59,480
Just push it up.

1066
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:00,480
Leave it at my elbow.

1067
00:40:03,760 --> 00:40:04,840
It's fine.

1068
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:15,400
She needs something to do.

1069
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,960
If she's not washing dishes,
then she's playing the piano.

1070
00:40:23,640 --> 00:40:24,960
She can play the piano as well.

1071
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:25,920
It sounds beautiful.

1072
00:40:37,390 --> 00:40:38,030
Wow.

1073
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:39,320
That sounds beautiful.

1074
00:40:54,520 --> 00:40:55,520
So good.

1075
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:57,560
This is the song I want to learn most.

1076
00:40:57,880 --> 00:40:58,800
Really?

1077
00:40:59,000 --> 00:40:59,840
Colorful Clouds Chasing the Moon.

1078
00:41:00,040 --> 00:41:00,880
Colorful Clouds Chasing the Moon.

1079
00:41:09,680 --> 00:41:10,380
You've really been practicing hard.

1080
00:41:10,380 --> 00:41:10,880
(Teasing)

1081
00:41:10,880 --> 00:41:11,680
No.

1082
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:20,000
It feels like

1083
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:21,680
a calf cramp.

1084
00:41:23,460 --> 00:41:25,020
(Helps with the cup)

1085
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:26,320
Thanks.

1086
00:41:27,200 --> 00:41:28,520
That's so thoughtful.

1087
00:41:32,240 --> 00:41:33,240
Why did it suddenly

1088
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:34,400
get so awkward?

1089
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:37,960
Suddenly in sync.

1090
00:41:41,160 --> 00:41:42,640
Why aren't they back yet?

1091
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:43,960
Good question.

1092
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:44,920
Why do you think?

1093
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:45,760
Why?

1094
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:47,280
They're on dates.

1095
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,200
Well,

1096
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:48,920
how would we know?

1097
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:51,760
How are their dates going this late?

1098
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:54,240
Why?

1099
00:41:56,560 --> 00:41:57,680
They must be having a great time.

1100
00:41:57,840 --> 00:41:59,440
(You really went there)
Look at you.

1101
00:41:59,440 --> 00:42:01,360
Seriously.

1102
00:42:02,680 --> 00:42:03,840
You're so mean.

1103
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:04,800
Honestly.

1104
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:07,520
Go away.

1105
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:08,680
What?

1106
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:11,800
You never really know someone.

1107
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:12,760
That's not what

1108
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:13,640
the girls wanted to hear.

1109
00:42:17,080 --> 00:42:18,640
What did you do

1110
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:19,280
with your other invitation card?

1111
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:20,240
Left it blank.

1112
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,240
What about you?

1113
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:24,640
Same here.

1114
00:42:25,520 --> 00:42:26,920
He asked me yesterday.

1115
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,200
Do we only have to write...

1116
00:42:29,600 --> 00:42:30,880
No.

1117
00:42:31,120 --> 00:42:31,920
Do we have to fill out both?

1118
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:32,720
Don't give too much away.

1119
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:35,200
Do we have to fill out both?

1120
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:36,200
She realized she said too much.

1121
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:38,000
No.

1122
00:42:38,720 --> 00:42:40,200
(The night before)
Give me the other card.

1123
00:42:42,160 --> 00:42:44,480
Should I give you some privacy then?

1124
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,160
(Joking)

1125
00:42:45,160 --> 00:42:46,080
The other one.

1126
00:42:47,120 --> 00:42:47,720
Why?

1127
00:42:48,920 --> 00:42:50,240
Don't the rules say you
can't give both to one person?

1128
00:42:50,240 --> 00:42:50,880
If you write one,

1129
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:52,200
the other one becomes invalid.

1130
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:54,240
And you still need privacy?

1131
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:55,960
Fine, I'll go.

1132
00:42:56,760 --> 00:42:58,080
No.

1133
00:42:58,080 --> 00:42:59,280
I'll give you some privacy.

1134
00:42:59,280 --> 00:43:00,000
Don't.

1135
00:43:00,360 --> 00:43:01,840
I'll step away.

1136
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:02,720
Hurry up and write it.

1137
00:43:04,160 --> 00:43:05,080
What do you think?

1138
00:43:05,080 --> 00:43:05,880
I don't know.

1139
00:43:06,200 --> 00:43:07,920
Just follow your heart.
No.

1140
00:43:08,280 --> 00:43:09,800
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

1141
00:43:09,800 --> 00:43:10,480
I...

1142
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:12,120
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

1143
00:43:12,960 --> 00:43:13,600
I'm freaking out.

1144
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:16,400
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

1145
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:17,280
Right.

1146
00:43:17,280 --> 00:43:17,800
Besides you,

1147
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:19,320
who else could he regret missing out on?

1148
00:43:19,440 --> 00:43:20,240
Tell us.

1149
00:43:21,160 --> 00:43:22,320
(Just here for the drama)
That's a trap question.

1150
00:43:22,320 --> 00:43:23,240
Who do you want to write to?

1151
00:43:24,200 --> 00:43:25,200
He's blushing.

1152
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:25,960
He's sweating.

1153
00:43:26,160 --> 00:43:27,200
No. Just you.

1154
00:43:30,200 --> 00:43:31,880
I'm shipping you so hard.

1155
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:34,280
Hurry up.

1156
00:43:34,280 --> 00:43:34,840
Play something.

1157
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:37,040
Don't play.

1158
00:43:37,960 --> 00:43:39,120
No.

1159
00:43:42,560 --> 00:43:43,920
This is so fun.

1160
00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:45,760
That's good.

1161
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:47,360
We've achieved

