kept going the way she always does.

1538
00:58:17,520 --> 00:58:19,560
Maybe this is the pause

1539
00:58:19,560 --> 00:58:20,600
she needed to stop

1540
00:58:20,600 --> 00:58:21,400
and think.

1541
00:58:22,080 --> 00:58:24,240
And that might actually be a good thing.

1542
00:58:24,560 --> 00:58:26,280
Every setback can be an opportunity.

1543
00:58:26,280 --> 00:58:27,480
If we can take a moment

1544
00:58:27,480 --> 00:58:28,800
to understand our emotions

1545
00:58:28,800 --> 00:58:31,040
and then look at how we act,

1546
00:58:31,040 --> 00:58:31,960
it gives us

1547
00:58:31,960 --> 00:58:33,560
a chance to grow past ourselves.

1548
00:58:37,400 --> 00:58:38,120
Do you think anyone's

1549
00:58:38,120 --> 00:58:39,040
come back before we do?

1550
00:58:39,520 --> 00:58:41,140
Probably. It's getting pretty late.

1551
00:58:41,520 --> 00:58:42,200
Thanks

1552
00:58:42,200 --> 00:58:43,280
