1553
00:58:43,280 --> 00:58:44,040
No problem.

1554
00:58:44,040 --> 00:58:45,080
AITO M6 does the driving for me.

1555
00:58:45,200 --> 00:58:45,800
It's equipped

1556
00:58:45,800 --> 00:58:47,720
