1557
00:58:47,720 --> 00:58:49,120
which makes driving really easy

1558
00:58:49,120 --> 00:58:50,280
and works well in all kinds of traffic.

1559
00:58:50,280 --> 00:58:51,000
Try it out.

1560
00:58:52,480 --> 00:58:54,480
Navigation Assist is on.

1561
00:58:54,480 --> 00:58:55,480
Why don't you take a break?

1562
00:58:55,480 --> 00:58:56,920
Or watch some videos or something.

1563
00:58:57,080 --> 00:58:57,880
Okay.

1564
00:58:57,880 --> 00:58:58,640
Xiao Yi,

1565
00:58:58,800 --> 00:59:00,080
