1569
00:59:04,600 --> 00:59:06,000
Maybe I'll watch a video.

1570
00:59:06,000 --> 00:59:07,400
That won't get in the way
of your navigation, right?

1571
00:59:07,400 --> 00:59:08,160
Not at all.

1572
00:59:08,160 --> 00:59:09,040
AITO M6 also

1573
00:59:09,040 --> 00:59:10,600
