1575
00:59:11,440 --> 00:59:12,000
It's really convenient.

1576
00:59:12,160 --> 00:59:12,920
So it's okay.

1577
00:59:12,960 --> 00:59:14,200
Awesome.

1578
00:59:15,160 --> 00:59:15,480
Sorry.

1579
00:59:15,480 --> 00:59:16,200
That was a bit of a hard brake.

1580
00:59:16,200 --> 00:59:17,340
(Chen Hewen & Liang Xiaoyu return)
It's okay.

1581
00:59:17,560 --> 00:59:18,440
Grab your flowers

1582
00:59:18,440 --> 00:59:19,640
and the cake.

1583
00:59:19,640 --> 00:59:20,440
Okay.

1584
00:59:20,440 --> 00:59:22,120
Chen Hewen and Liang Xiaoyu are back.

1585
00:59:22,780 --> 00:59:24,100
(Hands them over)

1586
00:59:24,200 --> 00:59:26,040
Come on, let's hurry.

1587
00:59:26,040 --> 00:59:26,760
Let's go.

1588
00:59:26,760 --> 00:59:27,600
Back to the house.

1589
00:59:27,840 --> 00:59:28,640
Let's go.

1590
00:59:32,280 --> 00:59:33,600
We'll get settled in our room first.

1591
00:59:34,040 --> 00:59:34,520
How was it?

1592
00:59:40,560 --> 00:59:41,600
She's in a pretty good mood.

1593
01:00:09,800 --> 01:00:11,000
He's sighing.

1594
01:00:13,080 --> 01:00:14,240
They're both thinking about it.

1595
01:00:18,880 --> 01:00:20,720
Feels like they're both reflecting

1596
01:00:20,720 --> 01:00:22,000
on what happened yesterday.

1597
01:00:24,520 --> 01:00:25,560
Sometimes you just need to take

1598
01:00:25,840 --> 01:00:26,920
